Compare Remote Config between two projects

Usage:
  fbrcm projects diff <source-project> <target-project> [flags]

Flags:
      --cached               Use cached Remote Config instead of live Firebase fetch
      --conditions           Include only condition changes
      --expr string          Filter parameter changes by expr-lang expression
  -f, --filter stringArray   Filter parameters by mode-prefixed query (^, /, ~, =); may be repeated
      --group stringArray    Select parameters in group; may be repeated
  -h, --help                 help for diff
      --json                 Print diff as JSON
      --parameters           Include only parameter and group description changes
      --search string        Search parameters by name, description, values, and conditions

Global Flags:
      --no-local-config    Ignore .fbrcm.toml repository configuration (env: FBRCM_NO_LOCAL_CONFIG)
      --profile string     Use profile for this invocation without changing the active profile (env: FBRCM_PROFILE)
      --stateless          Run a supported command without profiles or application-managed local state (Firebase API token env: FBRCM_GOOGLE_ACCESS_TOKEN)
      --timeout duration   Maximum duration for the complete command
